From fbb3c4ae551356634a7db30a06e5c364f61fbf48 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: retro98boy <retro98boy@qq.com>
Date: Sat, 29 Aug 2026 18:57:24 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] arm64: dts: rockchip: add K3B board and DSI panel overlay

Add the KICKPI K3B board description and a DT overlay for the optional JD9366-based 800x1280 DSI panel.

Keep the panel-specific regulators, backlight, reset GPIO, DSI configuration, and VOP routing in rk3562-kickpi-k3b-demo-dsi-panel.dtso so the base board DTB remains usable without the demo panel.
---
 arch/arm64/boot/dts/rockchip/Makefile         |   6 +
 .../rk3562-kickpi-k3b-demo-dsi-panel.dtso     | 280 ++++++++
 .../boot/dts/rockchip/rk3562-kickpi-k3b.dts   | 615 ++++++++++++++++++
 3 files changed, 901 insertions(+)
 create mode 100644 arch/arm64/boot/dts/rockchip/rk3562-kickpi-k3b-demo-dsi-panel.dtso
 create mode 100644 arch/arm64/boot/dts/rockchip/rk3562-kickpi-k3b.dts

